# No Icons in Buttons

Do not add icons inside buttons by default.
Buttons should only contain text unless the user explicitly requests an icon.
This applies to all Button components (e.g., Shadcn UI Button, custom buttons).

<example>
Bad:
<Button>
  <PlusIcon className="mr-2 h-4 w-4" />
  Add Item
</Button>

Good:
<Button>
  Add Item
</Button>
</example>
